                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,5,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Total Assignments</Run> - How many total assignments created</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Completed</Run> - Assignments with 100% tasks done</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Partial</Run> - Assignments with some tasks done (1-99%)</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Incomplete</Run> - Assignments with no tasks marked done</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,15">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Average Completion</Run> - Overall completion percentage across all assignments</TextBlock>

                        <TextBlock Text="2. 👥 Person Statistics" FontSize="13" FontWeight="Bold" Margin="0,10,0,5" Foreground="#1976d2"/>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,5">
                            Individual performance metrics for each person:
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,5,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Person</Run> - Name of the individual</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Total Assignments</Run> - How many times they were assigned</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Total Tasks</Run> - Combined task count across all assignments</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Completed Tasks</Run> - How many they completed</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Completion %</Run> - Color-coded completion rate (Green/Yellow/Red)</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,15">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Status</Run> - Overall completion status (Complete/Partial/Incomplete)</TextBlock>

                        <TextBlock Text="3. 📋 Task Statistics" FontSize="13" FontWeight="Bold" Margin="0,10,0,5" Foreground="#1976d2"/>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,5">
                            Analyze which tasks get completed consistently:
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,5,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Task Name</Run> - The task description</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Times Assigned</Run> - How often this task was given</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Times Completed</Run> - How many times it was finished</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Completion %</Run> - Color-coded completion rate</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,15">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Status</Run> - Always Done / Sometimes Done / Never Done</TextBlock>

                        <TextBlock Text="4. 📅 Trend Analysis" FontSize="13" FontWeight="Bold" Margin="0,10,0,5" Foreground="#1976d2"/>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,5">
                            Month-by-month completion trends:
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,5,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Month</Run> - Year and month (YYYY-MM)</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Complete (Green)</Run> - Fully completed assignments</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Partial (Yellow)</Run> - Partially completed assignments</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,3">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Incomplete (Red)</Run> - Unfinished assignments</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,0,0,15">• <Run FontWeight="Bold">Avg Completion %</Run> - Average completion for that month</TextBlock>

                        <TextBlock Text="Color Coding Guide:" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,15,0,5"/>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,5,0,5">🟢 <Run FontWeight="Bold">Green (100%)</Run> - Fully completed</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,5,0,5">🟡 <Run FontWeight="Bold">Yellow (1-99%)</Run> - Partially completed</TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,5,0,15">🔴 <Run FontWeight="Bold">Red (0%)</Run> - Not completed</TextBlock>

                        <TextBlock Text="Exporting Data:" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,10,0,5"/>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="15,5,0,3">
                            • <Run FontWeight="Bold">📋 Copy to Clipboard:</Run> Copy all statistics as formatted text for email/reports
