                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
                            • Create separate groups for different shifts
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
                            • Use constraints for role requirements (host, server, cook)
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
