                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
    • Disable analytics auto-refresh in Settings if dashboard is slow
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
