                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
    • Keep groups under 100 people/200 tasks for best performance
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,10">
    • Consider splitting very large teams into multiple groups
                        </TextBlock>

                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,10,0,5">
    <Run Text="💾 Data Backup Best Practices:" FontWeight="Bold"/>
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
