                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
    • Store backups on network drive or cloud storage
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
    • Keep at least 3 recent backups
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,5">
    • Test restoring a backup occasionally to verify it works
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,10">
